    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN\r\nESTATE & LETTING AGENTS \r\nOur business is you ....\r\n\r\nBREATHTAKING 3 BED / 3 BATH DUPLEX HOME OF DISTINCTION \r\nSTUNNING INTERIOR\r\nEXTRA SPACIOUS FLOOR PLAN\r\nFULLY UPGRADED KITCHEN WITH HIGH END APPLIANCES\r\nTWO LARGE SOUTH FACING TERRACES\r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES\r\n\r\n***Secure underground parking in a designated space, with a separate large storage locker.***\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED\r\n\r\nA most unique city home....\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Fairview Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this most unique home to the Dublin 3 property market. Modern properties boasting a spacious floor plan together with an excellent energy rating are rare to come to market.\r\n\r\nNo. 69 will appeal to first time buyers, , families, parties trading up / down and investors alike.\r\n\r\nNo. 69 offers a peaceful secluded setting with an array of amenities on your doorstep, yet the city is within close proximity.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan which is flooded with natural light comprises of: Hallway, bedroom / study, large living / dining room, kitchen & guest toilet. Upstairs there are 2 large bedrooms (one with en suite and primary bedroom has Jack and Jill bathroom with additional access from the landing).\r\n\r\nThe features of this most captivating home include: Quality flooring throughout, bespoke fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include integrated high end appliances, quality tiling and sanitary ware in all bathrooms, large south facing terrace off living / dining room and large south facing terrace off primary bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe property also features double glazed windows.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within close proximity of a wealth of local amenities. Drumcondra, Croke Parl, Clontarf, Fairview, Marino, East Point & East Wall are all on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
